                        For Indian students planning higher education abroad, understanding the top universities in Finland is an important first step. From world-renowned research institutions to industry-focused universities of applied sciences, Finland offers diverse academic pathways across engineering, business, technology, healthcare, sustainability, and more.
                    </p>
                    <p style="text-align:justify">
